//===== rAthena Script =======================================
//= iRO 2008 Christmas Event
//===== By: ==================================================
//= Kisuka
//===== Current Version: =====================================
//= 1.1
//===== Compatible With: =====================================
//= rAthena Project
//===== Description: =========================================
//= iRO Christmas Event. (2008)
//= Create Music Box and Cake.
//= Play card game with Santa.
//= Create Santa Suits.
//=
//= NOTE: Must enable X-mas08 mobs in mob_db2.
